    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596910/extras/56108d3182409c278fcca9f13cc08fa9.poster.avif?t=1750111482\" width=616 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596910/extras/56108d3182409c278fcca9f13cc08fa9.webm?t=1750111482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596910/extras/56108d3182409c278fcca9f13cc08fa9.mp4?t=1750111482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNBOXING</strong> is a puzzle-platformer where death is your key. Die, revive, and solve tricky puzzles using your companion box to return back to life. Push, throw, think and be prepared to explore a strange world of paradoxes. Will you find the cause of this endless cycle? Will you break free?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50+ Puzzles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>24 Unlockable Color Palettes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel a strange and paradoxical world</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Great Original Soundtrack</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596910/extras/c7171ed67f0f05e7c532acfc05801786.poster.avif?t=1750111482\" width=616 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596910/extras/c7171ed67f0f05e7c532acfc05801786.webm?t=1750111482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596910/extras/c7171ed67f0f05e7c532acfc05801786.mp4?t=1750111482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596910/extras/98f98b72c3ae297d2ee48817589c26e6.poster.avif?t=1750111482\" width=616 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596910/extras/98f98b72c3ae297d2ee48817589c26e6.webm?t=1750111482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596910/extras/98f98b72c3ae297d2ee48817589c26e6.mp4?t=1750111482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596910/extras/56108d3182409c278fcca9f13cc08fa9.poster.avif?t=1750111482\" width=616 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596910/extras/56108d3182409c278fcca9f13cc08fa9.webm?t=1750111482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596910/extras/56108d3182409c278fcca9f13cc08fa9.mp4?t=1750111482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNBOXING</strong> is a puzzle-platformer where death is your key. Die, revive, and solve tricky puzzles using your companion box to return back to life. Push, throw, think and be prepared to explore a strange world of paradoxes. Will you find the cause of this endless cycle? Will you break free?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50+ Puzzles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>24 Unlockable Color Palettes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel a strange and paradoxical world</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Great Original Soundtrack</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596910/extras/c7171ed67f0f05e7c532acfc05801786.poster.avif?t=1750111482\" width=616 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596910/extras/c7171ed67f0f05e7c532acfc05801786.webm?t=1750111482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596910/extras/c7171ed67f0f05e7c532acfc05801786.mp4?t=1750111482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596910/extras/98f98b72c3ae297d2ee48817589c26e6.poster.avif?t=1750111482\" width=616 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596910/extras/98f98b72c3ae297d2ee48817589c26e6.webm?t=1750111482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596910/extras/98f98b72c3ae297d2ee48817589c26e6.mp4?t=1750111482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
